{"ref":"BDB, מָאוֹר","hw":"מָאוֹר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מָאוֹר</span></big>  <strong>n.m. luminary</strong>—abs. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:16\" href=\"/Genesis.1.16\">Gn 1:16</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.30\">Pr 15:30</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאוֹרֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:15\" href=\"/Genesis.1.15\">Gn 1:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאֹרֹת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:14\" href=\"/Genesis.1.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:16\" href=\"/Genesis.1.16\">16</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאוֹרֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.8\">Ez 32:8</a>—<em>light, light-bearer, luminary, lamp</em>, of sun & moon <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:14\" href=\"/Genesis.1.14\">Gn 1:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:15\" href=\"/Genesis.1.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:16\" href=\"/Genesis.1.16\">16</a><sup>(×3)</sup> (P) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.8\">Ez 32:8</a>; moon <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:16\" href=\"/Psalms.74.16\">ψ 74:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מְנֹרַת הַמָּאוֹר</span> <em>the lamp-stand of the luminary</em> or <em>light</em> (where <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמּ׳</span> is sum of seven sacred lamps on golden lamp-stand) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:14\" href=\"/Exodus.35.14\">Ex 35:14</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:28\" href=\"/Exodus.35.28\">28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:37\" href=\"/Exodus.39.37\">39:37</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:9\" href=\"/Numbers.4.9\">Nu 4:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:16\" href=\"/Numbers.4.16\">16</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:6\" href=\"/Exodus.25.6\">Ex 25:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:20\" href=\"/Exodus.27.20\">27:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:8\" href=\"/Exodus.35.8\">35:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.2\">Lv 24:2</a> (all P); <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאוֹר־עֵינַיִם יְשַׂמַּח־לֵב֑</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.30\">Pr 15:30</a> <em>the luminary of the eyes</em> (= the eyes as a lamp) <em>gives the light of joy to the heart;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאוֹר פָּנֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 90:8\" href=\"/Psalms.90.8\">ψ 90:8</a> <em>the luminary of thy face</em> (thy face as a lamp) in the light of which the secrets are exposed.","next":"BDB, מְאוּרָה","prev":"BDB, יָאִירִי"}